          <caption>
            <p>Membranoproliferative Pattern of Injury: PAS and Jones Stains. The image shows a membranoproliferative pattern of injury with endocapillary hypercellularity (arrowhead) and focal glomerular basement membrane multilayering/remodeling (arrows). (A) PAS, 600&#x000d7;. (B) Jones, 600&#x000d7;. PAS: periodic acid-Schiff. Contributed by&#x000a0;C Dernell, MD</p>
          </caption>
