          <caption>
            <p>Electron Microscopy Demonstrating Microtubular Deposits within the Glomerular Basement Membranes. (A) This image shows a lower magnification view of the glomerular basement membranes and their microtubular deposits. (TEM, 20,000&#x000d7;). (B) This image shows a higher resolution, allowing a more detailed view of the microtubular structure (TEM, 50,000&#x000d7;). TEM: transmission electron microscope. Contributed by&#x000a0;C Dernell, MD</p>
